\begin{abstract}
This Assembly Line Blueprint defines the complete industrial workflow required
to fabricate, assemble, calibrate, and certify the near-term ENERGIZE hardware
platform using 2026 commercial and industrial technologies. The blueprint
includes subsystem fabrication cells, cryogenic integration stations, optical
alignment benches, QKD ingestion test bays, and full Hardware-In-The-Loop (HITL)
validation lanes.
\end{abstract}

% ============================================================
\section{Assembly Line Overview}
% ============================================================

The ENERGIZE assembly line consists of five major production zones:

\begin{itemize}
    \item Zone A — NV-Center Optical Fabrication Cell,
    \item Zone B — Cryogenic SNSPD Integration Cell,
    \item Zone C — UHV Chamber Construction \& Magnetic Isolation Cell,
    \item Zone D — FPGA Tensor Core \& QKD Modem Integration Cell,
    \item Zone E — Full HITL Validation \& Certification Lane.
\end{itemize}

Each zone is designed for parallel throughput and modular subsystem testing.

% ============================================================
\section{Zone A: NV-Center Optical Fabrication Cell}
% ============================================================

\subsection{Manufacturing Tasks}

\begin{itemize}
    \item CVD diamond substrate machining,
    \item NV-center implantation using $10\ \mathrm{keV}$ N$^+$ beam,
    \item Vacuum annealing at $800^\circ$C,
    \item Waveguide machining with $50\ \mathrm{nm}$ tolerance.
\end{itemize}

\subsection{Assembly Tasks}

\begin{itemize}
    \item Fiber coupling alignment ($<0.5\ \mu\mathrm{m}$),
    \item SC/APC optical port installation,
    \item ODMR linewidth verification.
\end{itemize}

% ============================================================
\section{Zone B: Cryogenic SNSPD Integration Cell}
% ============================================================

\subsection{Manufacturing Tasks}

\begin{itemize}
    \item NbTiN nanowire deposition ($8\ \mathrm{nm}$ thickness),
    \item Meander pattern lithography ($70\ \mathrm{nm}$ width),
    \item Sapphire substrate bonding.
\end{itemize}

\subsection{Assembly Tasks}

\begin{itemize}
    \item Gold wirebonding ($25\ \mu\mathrm{m}$),
    \item Cryo-RF coaxial routing,
    \item Dark count rate verification ($<1.2\times10^{-3}\ \mathrm{Hz}$).
\end{itemize}

% ============================================================
\section{Zone C: UHV Chamber Construction \& Magnetic Isolation}
% ============================================================

\subsection{Manufacturing Tasks}

\begin{itemize}
    \item Aluminum 6061-T6 inner shell machining,
    \item Dual-layer mu-metal shielding installation,
    \item ISO-K flange welding,
    \item Turbo-pump mounting.
\end{itemize}

\subsection{Assembly Tasks}

\begin{itemize}
    \item Evacuate chamber to $10^{-9}\ \mathrm{Torr}$,
    \item Helium leak test ($<10^{-10}\ \mathrm{Torr\cdot L/s}$),
    \item Magnetic suppression verification ($<0.1\ \mathrm{nT}$).
\end{itemize}

% ============================================================
\section{Zone D: FPGA Tensor Core \& QKD Modem Integration}
% ============================================================

\subsection{Manufacturing Tasks}

\begin{itemize}
    \item PCIe Gen5 x16 board installation,
    \item QSFP-DD fiber cage mounting,
    \item DDR5 ECC memory installation.
\end{itemize}

\subsection{Assembly Tasks}

\begin{itemize}
    \item SDR microwave receiver wiring (100GbE),
    \item Pulsar/CMB telemetry ingestion testing,
    \item Q-LDPC throughput verification ($\ge10.4\ \mathrm{Gbps}$).
\end{itemize}

% ============================================================
\section{Zone E: Full HITL Validation \& Certification Lane}
% ============================================================

\subsection{Validation Tasks}

\begin{itemize}
    \item Atomic state ingestion loop testing,
    \item Astrophysical QKD key masking verification,
    \item Encrypted tensor output validation,
    \item Buffer integrity audit ($>99.99\%$),
    \item Reconstruction fidelity test ($\mathcal{F} \ge 0.999999$).
\end{itemize}

\subsection{Certification Tasks}

\begin{itemize}
    \item Subsystem pass/fail logging,
    \item Final assembly sign-off,
    \item Deployment readiness certification.
\end{itemize}

